{"5243610":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BugPot","steam_appid":5243610,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/22ec4bb56107adbcba58143b1c28cbc3.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=1170 height=668 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/22ec4bb56107adbcba58143b1c28cbc3.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/22ec4bb56107adbcba58143b1c28cbc3.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>BugPot is a casual roguelike built around a deadly slot machine. Spin the reels, match weapons and charms and turn every combination into an attack against a wide variety of bugs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spin gives you something new to work with. Match weapons to deal damage, use charms to shape your strategy, upgrade your weapons, and find powerful combinations that can turn the fight in your favor. But the reels won't always give you what you want. Adapt to what you get, decide how to make the most of each spin, and keep your run alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/427946dab9aab5002e8d86ca0486b290.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=680 height=166 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/427946dab9aab5002e8d86ca0486b290.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/427946dab9aab5002e8d86ca0486b290.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapons are on the reels. Spin the machine and match weapons and charms to build your attack. Every result can open up a different way to approach the fight. Experiment with different weapons and charms, upgrade your weapons, and discover combinations that make each run play differently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/e4f36fbbfadd2d91e172f719116f572f.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=680 height=166 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/e4f36fbbfadd2d91e172f719116f572f.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/e4f36fbbfadd2d91e172f719116f572f.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a strange collection of bugs, each with their own personality and challenge. Learn what you're up against and adapt your strategy before they bring your run to an end. You can't control what comes up next, but you can control what you do with it. Make the most of every spin, push your luck, and find the setup you need to squash the next bug.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/326a9bb3e29c3ced16108b8600ec3e5a.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=680 height=166 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/326a9bb3e29c3ced16108b8600ec3e5a.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/326a9bb3e29c3ced16108b8600ec3e5a.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/22ec4bb56107adbcba58143b1c28cbc3.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=1170 height=668 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/22ec4bb56107adbcba58143b1c28cbc3.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/22ec4bb56107adbcba58143b1c28cbc3.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>BugPot is a casual roguelike built around a deadly slot machine. Spin the reels, match weapons and charms and turn every combination into an attack against a wide variety of bugs.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spin gives you something new to work with. Match weapons to deal damage, use charms to shape your strategy, upgrade your weapons, and find powerful combinations that can turn the fight in your favor. But the reels won't always give you what you want. Adapt to what you get, decide how to make the most of each spin, and keep your run alive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/427946dab9aab5002e8d86ca0486b290.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=680 height=166 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/427946dab9aab5002e8d86ca0486b290.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/427946dab9aab5002e8d86ca0486b290.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your weapons are on the reels. Spin the machine and match weapons and charms to build your attack. Every result can open up a different way to approach the fight. Experiment with different weapons and charms, upgrade your weapons, and discover combinations that make each run play differently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/e4f36fbbfadd2d91e172f719116f572f.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=680 height=166 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/e4f36fbbfadd2d91e172f719116f572f.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/e4f36fbbfadd2d91e172f719116f572f.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a strange collection of bugs, each with their own personality and challenge. Learn what you're up against and adapt your strategy before they bring your run to an end. You can't control what comes up next, but you can control what you do with it. Make the most of every spin, push your luck, and find the setup you need to squash the next bug.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/326a9bb3e29c3ced16108b8600ec3e5a.poster.avif?t=1793758507\" width=680 height=166 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/326a9bb3e29c3ced16108b8600ec3e5a.webm?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/extras\/326a9bb3e29c3ced16108b8600ec3e5a.mp4?t=1793758507\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"BugPot is a casual roguelike where every spin shapes the fight. Match weapons and charms, upgrade your weapons, build powerful combinations and adapt your strategy as you face a bizarre variety of bugs.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Turkish, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Czech, Finnish, Norwegian, Swedish, French, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Dutch, Bulgarian, Russian, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/afc1f614c35622dd4033aa453435a7bc88a3c9b6\/header.jpg?t=1793758507","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/367710e6770f7e9352261176e095486d69189a37\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793758507","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5243610\/367710e6770f7e9352261176e095486d69189a37\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793758507","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-4160, AMD FX-6300 (64-bit, SSE4.2)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 520, NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030, AMD Radeon R7 250<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> DirectX 11 capable GPU with 1 GB VRAM. Designed for 1920x1080. The game runs borderless at your desktop resolution, so a higher-resolution display costs proportionally more GPU.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recom